# 📖 TOEFL Reading - Day 03

## Passage

Scientists study space to understand the universe better.
Their research helps people develop new technologies and explore other planets.

---

## Question

Why do scientists study space?

A. To make airplanes

B. To understand the universe and develop technology

C. To travel every day

D. To change the weather

---

## Answer

B. To understand the universe and develop technology.

---

## Key Vocabulary

- universe = 우주
- develop = 개발하다
- technology = 기술
